Package: perl-lsp
Version: __RELEASE_VERSION__
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: __DEB_ARCH__
Maintainer: EffortlessMetrics <git@effortlesssteven.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/EffortlessMetrics/perl-lsp
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Description: High-performance Perl Language Server with 100% syntax coverage
 perl-lsp is a native Perl language server written in Rust.
 This package installs the perl-lsp and perl-dap executables from the release artifact.
